@startuml
skinparam participantPadding 10
actor EO1 as "Emergency Officer 1"
actor EO2 as "Emergency Officer 2"
actor Patient
participant Gateway
participant "Chain: Policy/Revocation/Events" as Chain
participant "Storage" as Storage
participant "Client (Emergency User)" as Client

== Activate ==
EO1 -> Chain: submit vote(caseId, reason, policyRef)
EO2 -> Chain: submit vote(caseId, reason, policyRef)
Chain --> Gateway: BreakGlassEvent(scope, TTL, caseId, policyRef)

== Issue emergency cap ==
Gateway -> Gateway: mint cap {breakGlass=true, singleUse, scope, TTL, revHandle, caseId}
Gateway -> Chain: mark revHandle active
Gateway --> Client: emergency capability
Gateway --> Patient: notify activation (channels per policy)

== Access ==
Client -> Gateway: request + capability + DPoP + device attest
Gateway -> Chain: check revHandle (must be active)
Gateway -> Chain: check policyRef/TTL
Gateway -> Storage: fetch ciphertext by CID
Gateway -> Gateway: verify anchor; unwrap key
Gateway --> Client: ciphertext + aad + wrappedKey
Client -> Client: decrypt + render
Gateway -> Chain: revoke revHandle (single-use)
Gateway --> Patient: notify access event (who/when/what)
Gateway -> Gateway: audit append; later anchor audit root
@enduml
